msgstr "इनपुट, डिमाल्टिप्लेक्सिं, डिक'डिं आरो एनक'डिंनि थाखाय सेटिं"

#: include/vlc_config_cat.h:92
msgid ""
"Settings related to the various access methods. Common settings you may want "
