msgid ""
"List of codecs that VLC will use in priority. For instance, 'dummy,a52' will "
"try the dummy and a52 codecs before trying the other ones. Only advanced "
"users should alter this option as it can break playback of all your streams."
msgstr ""
"codecs नि लिस्ट जायखौ VLC आ गिबि गोनांथि महरै बाहायगोन। बिदिन्थि महरै, "
"'dummy,a52' आ गुबुननि सोलायै डामि आरो a52 codecs खौ नाजागोन। खालि जौगानाय "
"बाहायग्राफोराल' बे उफ्राखौ सोलायनांगौ मानोना बेयो नोंथांनि गासै स्ट्रिमनि प्लेबेकखौ "
"सिफायनो हायो।"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1037
msgid "Enable hardware decoders"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1039
msgid ""
"VLC will fallback automatically to software decoders in case of hardware "
